# Base URL of the real indexer API, INCLUDING the /v1 prefix and without a
# trailing slash — e.g. https://piggygang-indexer.up.railway.app/v1.
# Leave it unset and every page serves committed fixture data through the same
# generated client (in-process, no network) — the default, so a fresh clone
# and a zero-config Vercel import work with no environment at all.
# Server-only on purpose: pages fetch in Server Components, so this never
# reaches the browser and the indexer needs no CORS.
API_BASE_URL=
